Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.95,0:00:03.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is the best operation that's done in orthopedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:04.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.87,0:00:07.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Many studies have shown it's the single best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:10.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,operation that Medicare pays for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:15.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everybody is very excited about getting their hip fixed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:19.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,when they can't walk, can't play, can't do their activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:24.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I see somebody who has a horrible hip, and it's the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:28.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,that's preventing them from being happy and being active,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,that's the best patient that can walk into my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure, sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:34.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Because they wake up, and they're like, "Oh my God, pain's gone."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:35.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's back. Thank you.
